{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.mug",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "新开的杂货屋里都是小东西",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.mug",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.mug",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈……拖了这么久，千雪，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不会，制作人先生才是，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没想到会拖这么久……喏，千雪。虽然是罐装咖啡。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哇，谢谢您。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……啊，真好喝。有种\"今天努力工作过了\"的味道。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是吗？不过千雪努力了是没错的。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——啊，",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不是。我在想昨天把马克杯摔了……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哎呀……没事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嘛，杯子是便宜货所以没关系，不过暂时得用罐装咖啡了……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那也太寂寞了……那，现在就去买好不好？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "新的马克杯。事务所附近新开了一家杂货屋哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，我都没注意到！那……能顺路去一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是，当然♪",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "就是这里，制作人先生——",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哇！您看，有好多可爱的小东西～！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "这条缎带也，超可爱的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "千雪真的很喜欢杂货屋啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "啊……对、对不起。一个人就兴奋起来了……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，千雪开心就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不，不由得就看入迷了……得找制作人先生的杯子才行。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……哇，茶杯也有好多……！这边，制作人先生！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "千雪可以去看喜欢的杂货哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不，今天马克杯才是大事。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "我们来找适合制作人先生的东西吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢，千雪。托千雪的福，找到好东西了。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哪里，不敢当……总觉得那个，我也想要了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，有那么好吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，下次我会小心不摔了。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵……请一定小心哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "来，回去之后，马上就用它喝咖啡吧♪"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T11:00:00.000Z",
